  "notes": "Smoke-only charging correction. The production image is explicitly built with Dev Mode disabled. Fixes the real regression where any BLE search or active BLE connection suppressed the charger transition, making the tester appear to run in Dev Mode. Ordinary BLE can no longer block charging; only a bounded five-second post-OTA reconnect guard may defer an already-attached cable. A manually powered-off tester now wakes into a temporary charging session while retaining its off fence, so unplugging returns it to the intentional off state instead of powering it on. Includes the direct selected-density Start, false cartridge-fault, smooth error animation and shutdown fixes from 2.3.111. Twin Button firmware content remains unchanged.",
